Package: moe
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: desktop mascot companion for V\OS
 Moe is a small companion creature that sits on the desktop: it watches
 the active window, can be dragged around, carries per-file attributes
 for size and motion, and ships with anime-style animations.
